# Landscapes

Landscape photos are selected by orientation (width > height):

```
width > height
```

This demonstrates dimension-based filtering.

**Photo viewer:** Dedicated page. Select a photo to open its canonical URL with previous, next, and return navigation.

**Expected:** 8 images (all landscape orientation)
